=== D-203 / class superseded-helper-left-unreachable: the two names in casting 1 ===
  The pin casting 3 ships this cycle takes as SUBJECTS every Import and
  ImportFrom alias in every shipped .py, and asks per file whether the bound
  name is READ there. The question is AST-shaped -- ast.Name, ast.Attribute,
  or an exact string Constant -- and so is blind to comments, which is the
  point: measure-run.py names _archive_metrics in two comments that survive
  this deletion, and a comment citing an import is history, not a reference.
  from __future__ import is exempt by construction: annotations is a compiler
  directive no module ever reads back.

